{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Code Quality Review",
  "description": "Analyzes modified source files for code smells, design pattern opportunities, and best practices, suggesting improvements to readability, maintainability, and performance without changing functionality.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "src/**/*.ts",
      "src/**/*.tsx",
      "app/**/*.ts",
      "app/**/*.tsx"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "A source file was just edited and saved. Review the changes in this file for potential improvements:\n\n1. Code smells (duplication, long functions, deep nesting, magic numbers/strings, unclear naming)\n2. Opportunities to apply better design patterns idiomatic to React/React Native and TypeScript\n3. Best practices for readability and maintainability\n4. Performance optimizations (unnecessary re-renders, missing memoization, inefficient loops, etc.)\n\nDo NOT change the functionality or behavior of the code. Present suggestions as a concise list with brief rationale, and only apply the edits if they are low-risk, non-breaking improvements. For anything that changes behavior or is a matter of style preference, just suggest it and ask before applying."
  }
}